Provenance of the GBA machine layer (runtime/guests/gba, without bios/)

The timing behavior of the bus, the devices and the display is ported from
ares, https://github.com/ares-emulator/ares, commit
0b928930af4cc59ed99e942996f0d3c815379388, ISC license (text below). The
code here is new C11 in relift's scheduler shape (closed forms of the tick
and scheduler events instead of per-cycle threads); each ported file keeps
the ISC notice in its header.

bus.c     wait states, Game Pak bursts and the 128 KiB page rule, the
          prefetch buffer          gba/cpu/bus.cpp, prefetch.cpp, memory.cpp,
                                   gba/cartridge/mrom.cpp
irq.c     IE, IF, IME and their pipeline, the halt loop
                                   gba/cpu/cpu.cpp, io.cpp
timer.c   prescalers, cascade, overflow, the control and reload latches
                                   gba/cpu/timer.cpp, io.cpp, cpu.cpp
dma.c     channels, start delay, priorities, latches, special starts
                                   gba/cpu/dma.cpp, io.cpp, timer.cpp
lcd.c     VCOUNT, DISPSTAT and the line edges
                                   gba/display/display.cpp, io.cpp
io.c      system register values, byte-wise register access
                                   gba/cpu/io.cpp, gba/memory/memory.cpp
ppu/      the picture unit: registers, backgrounds, sprites, windows, blending,
          the render order of the fast path
                                   gba/ppu/io.cpp, background.cpp, object.cpp,
                                   window.cpp, dac.cpp, ppu.cpp, memory.cpp
mem.c     VRAM mirror and bitmap-mode rules, byte writes to palette, VRAM
          and OAM, the memory control register
                                   gba/ppu/memory.cpp, gba/cpu/memory.cpp

Changes found by the differential tests against NanoBoyAdvance and the
console probe records: the prefetch buffer ends the Game Pak burst when it
stops full (the next fetch is nonsequential), a DMA requests its interrupt
at the end of the transfer, and the prefetch unit starts idle at power on.

